</style><script type="text/javascript">window.__WEBFLOW_CURRENCY_SETTINGS = {"currencyCode":"USD","symbol":"$","decimal":".","fractionDigits":2,"group":",","template":"{{wf {\"path\":\"symbol\",\"type\":\"PlainText\"} }} {{wf {\"path\":\"amount\",\"type\":\"CommercePrice\"} }} {{wf {\"path\":\"currencyCode\",\"type\":\"PlainText\"} }}","hideDecimalForWholeNumbers":false};</script></head><body><div class="navbarnotification-bar"><div class="notification-bar hidden"></div><div data-animation="default" data-collapse="medium" data-duration="1" data-easing="ease" data-easing2="ease" role="banner" class="navbar w-nav"><div class="navbar-container narrow"><a href="/" class="navbar__logo w-nav-brand"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/615addcd910b6e8f65bde306/615addcd910b6e31f6bde33e_default.svg" loading="lazy" alt="Wynter logo"/></a><div class="navbar__control"><nav role="navigation" class="navbar__control__links w-nav-menu"><div class="w-layout-grid navbar__control__links__wrapper"><div id="w-node-d87b2a7d-e7d8-a94e-63b1-ab591a0c7f15-1a0c7f07" class="w-layout-grid navbar__control__links__grid"><div class="navbar__control__links__link-dropdown"><div data-hover="true" data-delay="0" class="navbar__dropdown w-dropdown"><div class="navbar__dropdown__toggle regular w-dropdown-toggle"><div>Capabilities</div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/615addcd910b6e8f65bde306/615addcd910b6e2453bde336_chevron--accordion.svg" loading="lazy" alt=""/><a href="/pricing" class="navbar__control__links__link-alone regular w-inline-block"><div>Pricing</div></a></div><nav class="navbar__dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="w-layout-grid navbar__dropdown-list__grid _3"><div class="navbar__dropdown-list__grid__grouped-wrapper"><div class="navbar__dropdown-list__grid__grouped__section-title"><div class="navbar__dropdown-list__grid__grouped__section-title__container"><div class="text-block">On-demand research you can do with Wynter. Results in under 48 hours.</div></div></div><div class="navbar__dropdown-list__link__grid _2"><a href="https://wynter.com/products/message-testing" class="navbar__dropdown-list__link w-inline-block"><div class="navbar__dropdown-list__link__heading">B2B message testing</div><div class="navbar__dropdown-list__link__description">Know what your target customers think about your messaging.</div></a><a href="https://wynter.com/target-customer-surveys-b2b" class="navbar__dropdown-list__link w-inline-block"><div class="navbar__dropdown-list__link__heading">Market research surveys for B2B</div><div class="navbar__dropdown-list__link__description">Target customer surveys with B2B audiences.</div></a><a href="/solutions/brand-tracking" class="navbar__dropdown-list__link w-inline-block"><div class="navbar__dropdown-list__link__heading">B2B brand tracking</div><div class="navbar__dropdown-list__link__description">Track brand metrics like awareness over time.</div></a><a href="/landing-page-testing" class="navbar__dropdown-list__link w-inline-block"><div class="navbar__dropdown-list__link__heading">Landing page testing</div><div class="navbar__dropdown-list__link__description">Test copy on your landing pages to improve conversions. </div></a><a href="https://wynter.com/preference-testing" class="navbar__dropdown-list__link w-inline-block"><div class="navbar__dropdown-list__link__heading">Preference testing</div><div class="navbar__dropdown-list__link__description">Discover which landing page or value proposition works best.</div></a><a href="https://wynter.com/pricing-page-test" class="navbar__dropdown-list__link w-inline-block"><div class="navbar__dropdown-list__link__heading">Pricing page tests</div><div class="navbar__dropdown-list__link__description">Learn if your ICPs get your pricing and see the value.</div></a></div></div></div></nav></div></div><a href="https://grader.wynter.com/" class="navbar__control__links__link-alone regular w-inline-block"><div>AI messaging grader</div></a><div class="navbar__control__links__link-dropdown"><div data-hover="true" data-delay="0" class="navbar__dropdown w-dropdown"><div class="navbar__dropdown__toggle regular w-dropdown-toggle"><div>Learning hub</div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/615addcd910b6e8f65bde306/615addcd910b6e2453bde336_chevron--accordion.svg" loading="lazy" alt=""/></div><nav class="navbar__dropdown-list left narrow w-dropdown-list"><div class="w-layout-grid navbar__dropdown-list__grid ungrouped-2 narrow"><a id="w-node-_51fda619-8a2b-8439-b61c-8eb4404060e1-1a0c7f07" href="/subscribe" class="navbar__dropdown-list__link text__left w-inline-block"><div class="navbar__dropdown-list__link__heading">Weekly newsletter</div><div class="navbar__dropdown-list__link__description">Join our &quot;Beyond the product&quot;<br/>community</div></a><a id="w-node-e5784c7b-f6d1-1bf4-2abb-b38d20dcd337-1a0c7f07" href="https://wynter.com/examples" class="navbar__dropdown-list__link text__left w-inline-block"><div class="navbar__dropdown-list__link__heading">Take a tour of Wynter</div><div class="navbar__dropdown-list__link__description">How to use Wynter</div></a><a id="w-node-_20cb666c-427d-2042-6cce-5b1f0d8811c4-1a0c7f07" href="/workshop" class="navbar__dropdown-list__link text__left w-inline-block"><div class="navbar__dropdown-list__link__heading">Wynter workshops</div><div class="navbar__dropdown-list__link__description">Register for the next online workshop</div></a><a id="w-node-_0140d282-6a73-26f9-bb1b-a78076df37b9-1a0c7f07" href="/blog" class="navbar__dropdown-list__link text__left w-inline-block"><div class="navbar__dropdown-list__link__heading">Articles</div><div class="navbar__dropdown-list__link__description">Messaging, market research, brand marketing</div></a><a id="w-node-_4013fa63-53e4-b3b5-92af-7add1a26d602-1a0c7f07" href="/research" class="navbar__dropdown-list__link text__left w-inline-block"><div class="navbar__dropdown-list__link__heading">Original research</div><div class="navbar__dropdown-list__link__description">Access studies we conducted</div></a><a id="w-node-e5784c7b-f6d1-1bf4-2abb-b38d20dcd341-1a0c7f07" href="/messaging-course" class="navbar__dropdown-list__link text__left w-inline-block"><div class="navbar__dropdown-list__link__heading">B2B messaging course</div><div class="navbar__dropdown-list__link__description">Learn how to create effective<br/>messaging</div></a></div></nav></div></div></div><div id="w-node-d87b2a7d-e7d8-a94e-63b1-ab591a0c7f88-1a0c7f07" class="w-layout-grid navbar__control__links__grid"><div data-hover="true" data-delay="0" class="navbar__dropdown w-dropdown"><div class="navbar__dropdown__toggle regular w-dropdown-toggle"><div>For participants</div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/615addcd910b6e8f65bde306/615addcd910b6e2453bde336_chevron--accordion.svg" loading="lazy" alt=""/></div><nav class="navbar__dropdown-list left narrow w-dropdown-list"><div class="w-layout-grid navbar__dropdown-list__grid _1 padding__24px"><a id="w-node-_2e747fcc-d87d-a573-22fc-ef6a875425a8-1a0c7f07" href="https://wynter.com/panelists/join" class="navbar__dropdown-list__link text__left w-inline-block"><div class="navbar__dropdown-list__link__heading">Sign up</div><div class="navbar__dropdown-list__link__description">Become a participant, get paid</div></a><a id="w-node-_2e747fcc-d87d-a573-22fc-ef6a875425b2-1a0c7f07" href="https://audiences.wynter.io/signin?to=%2F" class="navbar__dropdown-list__link text__left w-inline-block"><div class="navbar__dropdown-list__link__heading">Participant login</div><div class="navbar__dropdown-list__link__description">Update details</div></a></div></nav></div><div class="navbar__control__links__link-button"><a href="/log-in-redirection" class="navbar__control__links__link-alone regular w-inline-block"><div>Log in</div></a><a href="/signup-redirection" class="button-3 small w-button">Sign up free</a></div></div></div></nav><div class="navbar__control__hamburger w-nav-button"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/615addcd910b6e8f65bde306/615addcd910b6e79f9bde33f_menu%201.svg" loading="lazy" alt=""/></div></div></div></div></div><div class="wfu-mt"><section class="wfu-mt-hero"><div class="wfu-mt-hero-grid"><div><span class="wfu-mt-eyebrow">B2B Message Testing</span><h1 class="wfu-mt-h1">Stop guessing what your messaging is doing.</h1><p class="wfu-mt-sub">Run a message test with verified B2B buyers in your target market. Get the data in under 48 hours.</p><div class="wfu-mt-quote"><span class="wfu-mt-quote-text">&quot;I feel way more confident when messaging is passed by Wynter. Everybody can punch harder when they&#x27;ve got the right support.&quot;</span><div class="wfu-mt-quote-who"><span class="wfu-mt-quote-avatar">AD</span><span><span class="wfu-mt-quote-name">Andrew Davies</span> <span class="wfu-mt-quote-role">CMO, Paddle</span></span></div></div><div class="wfu-mt-ctas"><a href="https://wynter.com/demo-routing" class="button">Book a demo</a><a href="https://wynter.com/signup-redirection" class="button outline">Sign up free</a></div></div><div class="w-embed w-script"><script src="https://fast.wistia.com/player.js" async></script><script src="https://fast.wistia.com/embed/zllga6z4b4.js" async type="module"></script><style>wistia-player[media-id='zllga6z4b4']:not(:defined) { background: center / contain no-repeat url('https://fast.wistia.com/embed/medias/zllga6z4b4/swatch'); display: block; filter: blur(5px); padding-top:52.92%; }</style> <wistia-player media-id="zllga6z4b4" aspect="1.889763779527559"></wistia-player></div></div></section><section class="wfu-mt-problem"><div class="wfu-mt-problem-inner"><h2 class="wfu-mt-h2">Most teams test messaging with the <span class="wfu-mt-h2-em">wrong people</span>.</h2><p class="wfu-mt-problem-sub">Internal debate. Your team&#x27;s gut. The 3 customers you happen to know. None of it tells you what your actual buyers think before you ship.</p><div class="wfu-mt-problem-grid"><div class="wfu-mt-problem-cell"><span class="wfu-mt-pnum">01</span><span class="wfu-mt-ph3">The &quot;stakeholder review&quot;</span><span class="text__body-small">Marketing sends a doc, sales pushes back, the CEO has opinions, everyone leaves with bruised egos and no resolution. Nothing got tested.</span></div><div class="wfu-mt-problem-cell"><span class="wfu-mt-pnum">02</span><span class="wfu-mt-ph3">The 5-person customer call</span><span class="text__body-small">You ask three loyal customers what they think. They tell you it&#x27;s great. Your pipeline doesn&#x27;t care what your loyal customers think.</span></div><div class="wfu-mt-problem-cell"><span class="wfu-mt-pnum">03</span><span class="wfu-mt-ph3">The 8-week A/B test</span><span class="text__body-small">By the time conversion data hits significance, the campaign is over and the page has shipped. Set up a Wynter test Friday afternoon. Have results Monday morning.</span></div></div></div></section></div><div><section class="wfu-mt-case"><div class="wfu-mt-case-grid"><div><span class="wfu-mt-case-eb">Customer story</span><h2 class="wfu-mt-case-title">How Cognism increased conversions <span class="wfu-mt-case-title-em">43%</span> by testing messaging with Wynter.</h2><span class="wfu-mt-case-body">Cognism shifted from lead-gen to demand-gen, which meant rethinking the entire website. Instead of relying on gut, they tested messaging with verified ICP buyers on Wynter before shipping changes to demo and home pages.</span><div class="wfu-mt-case-quote"><span class="wfu-mt-case-quote-text">&quot;Using Wynter has been a game changer. We are approaching each high-intent page as a unique project, gaining real feedback from our ICP, and implementing changes based on that. The result: 43% and 40.22% conversion increases on demo and home pages.&quot;</span><span class="wfu-mt-case-quote-attr">Alice de Courcy, CMO, Cognism</span></div><a href="https://wynter.com/case-studies/cognism" class="wfu-mt-case-link">Read the full Cognism story <!-- -->→</a></div><div class="wfu-mt-case-right"><div class="wfu-mt-case-logo">Cognism</div><div class="wfu-mt-case-stat"><span class="wfu-mt-case-stat-num">+43%</span><span class="text__body-small">conversion rate increase on Cognism&#x27;s demo page after testing the messaging</span></div><div class="wfu-mt-case-stat"><span class="wfu-mt-case-stat-num">+40%</span><span class="text__body-small">conversion rate increase on the home page using the same approach</span></div><div class="wfu-mt-case-stat"><span class="wfu-mt-case-stat-num">&lt;<!-- -->48h</span><span class="text__body-small">turnaround from launching a test to having actionable results</span></div></div></div></section><section class="wfu-mt-learn"><div class="wfu-mt-learn-inner"><div class="wfu-mt-learn-header"><span class="wfu-mt-case-eb">What you&#x27;ll learn</span><h2 class="wfu-mt-learn-title">Specific answers to the questions you can&#x27;t get from your team.</h2><span class="text__body-medium">A message test isn&#x27;t a generic survey. It&#x27;s a structured set of questions designed to surface exactly where your messaging works and where it falls apart.</span></div><div class="wfu-mt-learn-list"><div class="wfu-mt-learn-item"><span class="wfu-mt-learn-check">✓</span><span class="wfu-mt-learn-q">Which of the arguments we&#x27;re making actually resonate?</span></div><div class="wfu-mt-learn-item"><span class="wfu-mt-learn-check">✓</span><span class="wfu-mt-learn-q">Which benefits are they most interested in?</span></div><div class="wfu-mt-learn-item"><span class="wfu-mt-learn-check">✓</span><span class="wfu-mt-learn-q">What does the headline make them feel?</span></div><div class="wfu-mt-learn-item"><span class="wfu-mt-learn-check">✓</span><span class="wfu-mt-learn-q">Does the reader feel we understand their role and challenges?</span></div><div class="wfu-mt-learn-item"><span class="wfu-mt-learn-check">✓</span><span class="wfu-mt-learn-q">What&#x27;s confusing or unclear?</span></div><div class="wfu-mt-learn-item"><span class="wfu-mt-learn-check">✓</span><span class="wfu-mt-learn-q">What objections are we not addressing?</span></div><div class="wfu-mt-learn-item"><span class="wfu-mt-learn-check">✓</span><span class="wfu-mt-learn-q">How do we compare to the alternatives in their mind?</span></div><div class="wfu-mt-learn-item"><span class="wfu-mt-learn-check">✓</span><span class="wfu-mt-learn-q">Do they get why choose us over the competition?</span></div></div></div></section></div><div><section class="wfu-mt-how"><div class="wfu-mt-how-inner"><div class="wfu-mt-how-header"><span class="wfu-mt-how-eb">How it works</span><h2 class="wfu-mt-how-title">From launch to results, in under 48 hours.</h2><span class="text__body-medium">Self-serve. No scoping calls. No timeline negotiation. You decide the page you want to test, we deliver the audience, results land in your inbox in two days.</span></div><div class="wfu-mt-how-steps"><div class="wfu-mt-step"><span class="wfu-mt-step-num">STEP 01</span><span class="wfu-mt-step-h3">Define your audience</span><span class="text__body-small">Pick from 86,015+ verified B2B professionals: industry, company size, role, region. Self-serve audience builder, no sales call required.</span><div class="wfu-mt-step-duration"><strong>~2 minutes</strong> to scope</div></div><div class="wfu-mt-step"><span class="wfu-mt-step-num">STEP 02</span><span class="wfu-mt-step-h3">Upload what you want tested</span><span class="text__body-small">A landing page, an ad, a deck slide, a paragraph of copy. Wynter&#x27;s message test asks the right questions about each.</span><div class="wfu-mt-step-duration"><strong>~1 minutes</strong> to set up</div></div><div class="wfu-mt-step"><span class="wfu-mt-step-num">STEP 03</span><span class="wfu-mt-step-h3">Get the data</span><span class="text__body-small">Quantitative scores and qualitative quotes from every respondent, organized by question, role, and segment. You decide what to change.</span><div class="wfu-mt-step-duration"><strong>&lt;<!-- -->48 hours</strong> turnaround</div></div></div></div></section><section class="wfu-mt-final"><div class="wfu-mt-final-grid"><div><h2 class="wfu-mt-final-title">Run a message test <span class="wfu-mt-final-title-em">this week</span>.</h2><span class="wfu-mt-final-sub">No annual contract. No minimum spend. Pay per test. Set up your first one in 20 minutes, get results before your next standup.</span></div><div class="wfu-mt-final-side"><div class="wfu-mt-final-stat"><span class="wfu-mt-final-stat-num">+43%</span><span class="wfu-mt-final-stat-p">conversion increase on Cognism&#x27;s demo page after testing the messaging with Wynter.</span></div><hr class="wfu-mt-final-hr wfu-mt-final-hr"/><div class="wfu-mt-final-stat"><span class="wfu-mt-final-stat-num">86,015+</span><span class="wfu-mt-final-stat-p">verified B2B professionals across SaaS, financial services, professional services, and more.</span></div></div></div></section></div><div class="section-blog-category-template cta background-gray w-condition-invisible"><div class="main-container-blog-post"><div class="section-layout__1-7-1"><div id="w-node-a4ff9305-38eb-21dd-b5df-6ea279c199f3-e2455747" class="content-container justify-center"><h2 class="w-dyn-bind-empty"></h2><div class="wrapper__button-calculator no-margin"><div class="wrapper__second-button"><a href="https://app.wynter.io/signin" class="button-4 w-button"><strong>Sign up and buy demos</strong></a></div><div class="wrapper__second-button"><a href="https://wynter.com/demo-routing" class="button-4 outline w-button"><strong>Schedule a call</strong></a></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="section-blog-category-template background-2"><div class="main-container-blog-post"><div id="w-node-d4ac198b-263f-d4c5-1fee-1a67b396b29f-e2455747" class="w-layout-layout home wf-layout-layout"><div class="w-layout-cell"><a href="https://wynter.com/demo-routing" class="button mobile w-button"><strong>Book a demo</strong></a></div><div class="w-layout-cell"><a href